-- The compiler's xor template (pop rcx; pop rax; xor rax, rcx; push rax) on a generic state, by refl: the
-- code anywhere in [2^43, 2^44), the stack anywhere in [3·2^45, 3·2^45 + 2^44), the two top words any
-- words, the memory below them any memory, rax, rcx and rflags anything. After four steps rsp is 8 up,
-- rip 6 on, and the top word is the xor of the two.
